id: cloaking-system-third-effect
name: Cloaking System
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerBaseTier: 10
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: cloaking-system
fromEffect: 3
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Cloaking System's third effect, as a Maneuver: 1 Action and 10(bT) Ki Points, the Invisible State.
text: >
  (3)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 and a Ki Point Cost of 10(bT), enter the Invisible State.

---

# The Invisible State, its mark beside it for (5).
[on used]
enterState(invisible, 1);
gain(cloaked);
